Filetype: IR signals file
Version: 1
#
# FiiO DM15 (R2R) CD player - original remote
# Captured with a Flipper Zero on 2026-09-03; every button replayed and verified on the player.
# NECext, address 0xBDBE, 8-bit commands 0x00-0x16 with complement (Flipper shows e.g. 0xFA05 for 0x05).
# Holding Prev / Next (and Vol_up / Vol_dn) sends NEC repeat frames every ~100 ms:
# the player then seeks inside the track (or ramps the volume).
# No power code: the remote has none, and 0x17-0xFF were swept with the player on and off, no response.
# Mode behaves like Play_pause on firmware MCU V1.48.02 (it has its own code, 0x0B; the remap is in the player).
#
name: Play_pause
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: BE BD 00 00
command: 05 FA 00 00
#
name: Prev
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: BE BD 00 00
command: 03 FC 00 00
#
name: Next
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: BE BD 00 00
command: 04 FB 00 00
#
name: Display
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: BE BD 00 00
command: 01 FE 00 00
#
name: Stop
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: BE BD 00 00
command: 02 FD 00 00
#
name: Menu
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: BE BD 00 00
command: 00 FF 00 00
